          "Target ordinary interactive query/edit p95 <=100ms at 1000 elements and no >50ms browser main-thread task; calibrate with native baselines, provide progress/cancel for longer work. No performance acceptance is claimed until measured. [TIMING POLICY SUPERSEDED 2026-10-28: Measure workload-specific latency ranges and outliers under performance-policy.json; report distinct event-to-visible latency, main-thread task durations and allocation metrics. Preserve raw timing evidence; no single50ms veto or automatic parity acceptance. Keep actual responsiveness, cancellation and exact-data checks.]"
